cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use camt053-writer-xlsx in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "camt053-writer-xlsx: Excel writer for ISO 20022 camt.053 bank statements"
abstract: >-
  Writes a camt053 ParsedDocument, the model the camt053 library produces
  from ISO 20022 camt.053 XML and the camt053 MT940 and MT942 loaders
  produce from SWIFT text, to a four-sheet Excel workbook (Metadata,
  Balances, Entries, Reversals) with a column layout stable across releases.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.24"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/camt053-writer-xlsx"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/camt053-writer-xlsx/"
keywords:
  - ISO 20022
  - camt.053
  - bank statements
  - Excel
  - xlsx
